# EduFusion: Full Ground-Up Modular Rewrite Plan

## Goal

Rewrite the app so that:
1. **Every module** (students, academics, finance, etc.) can be modified, removed, or added by hand **without touching other modules**.
2. **Every file** is focused (<200 lines), with a single responsibility.  
3. **The app never crashes** from a missing feature — graceful fallbacks everywhere.
4. **Adding a new module** is a 5-step, copy-paste process.
5. Design system, security, and clean-code principles are enforced structurally.

---

## Current State Analysis

| Area | Problem |
|---|---|
| **router.dart** | 512-line monolith importing **all 100+ pages**. One broken import = build failure. |
| **Screens** | Several >200 lines, mixing business logic with UI. |
| **Routes** | All in one file. No module isolation. |
| **Side menu** | [side_menu_data.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/data/side_menu_data.dart) is a 23KB single file. |
| **BLoC** | Some blocs have mixed Event/State in single file. |
| **DI / get_it** | Services registered ad-hoc, no module-scoped DI. |
| **No module contract** | Nothing enforces the interface that a new module must implement. |

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This plan is a rewrite strategy, not a bug fix.** I will NOT delete working code — every change is additive/refactoring. All changes are made one module at a time so the app keeps running throughout. **Phases 1–3 are pure scaffolding (no user-visible change).** Phases 4–9 are per-module refactors.

> [!WARNING]
> **[router.gr.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/routes/router.gr.dart) is auto-generated** — we never edit it by hand. After any route structure change, we run `dart run build_runner build` to regenerate it.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Module Registration Contract

The core innovation: every module must declare a `FeatureModule` that exports its routes, sidebar entry, and DI registrations. This way, [router.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/routes/router.dart) and [side_menu_data.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/data/side_menu_data.dart) never need to change to add a new module.

---

#### [NEW] `lib/core/modules/feature_module.dart`

Abstract base that every module must implement:

```dart
abstract class FeatureModule {
  // The auto_route route for this module's shell
  AutoRoute get route;
  
  // Sidebar entry (icon, label, path)
  SidebarEntry get sidebarEntry;
  
  // Called once at app startup to register DI
  void registerDependencies(GetIt sl);
}
```

#### [NEW] `lib/core/modules/module_registry.dart`

A single place that lists all active modules:

```dart
class ModuleRegistry {
  static final List<FeatureModule> modules = [
    StudentsModule(),
    StaffModule(),
    AcademicsModule(),
    FinanceModule(),
    ExamsModule(),
    AttendanceModule(),
    CommunicationModule(),
    SettingsModule(),
    ReportsModule(),
  ];
}
```

→ To add a new module: add one line here. To remove a module: remove one line. Nothing else needs to change.

#### [MODIFY] [lib/routes/router.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/routes/router.dart)

Router rebuilds its route list from `ModuleRegistry`:

```dart
@override
List<AutoRoute> get routes => [
  AutoRoute(page: LoginRoute.page, path: '/login'),
  AutoRoute(
    page: MainRoute.page,
    path: '/',
    initial: true,
    children: ModuleRegistry.modules.map((m) => m.route).toList(),
  ),
];
```

**Result: router.dart goes from 512 lines → ~30 lines.**

#### [MODIFY] [lib/data/side_menu_data.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/data/side_menu_data.dart)

Replace hardcoded list with:
```dart
List<SidebarEntry> get sidebarEntries =>
    ModuleRegistry.modules.map((m) => m.sidebarEntry).toList();
```

---

### Phase 2 — Per-Module Route Files

Each module gets its own route file. Example for Students:

#### [NEW] `lib/presentation/screens/students/students_module.dart`

```dart
class StudentsModule implements FeatureModule {
  @override
  AutoRoute get route => AutoRoute(
    page: StudentsShellRoute.page,
    path: 'students',
    children: StudentsRoutes.children,
  );

  @override
  SidebarEntry get sidebarEntry => const SidebarEntry(
    icon: Icons.people_alt_outlined,
    label: 'Students',
    path: '/students',
  );

  @override
  void registerDependencies(GetIt sl) {
    sl.registerLazySingleton<StudentRepository>(() => StudentRepositoryImpl(sl()));
  }
}
```

#### [NEW] `lib/presentation/screens/students/students_routes.dart`

Contains only the `children` list for the students shell. Zero imports from other modules.

**Repeat this pattern for every module:**

| Module | Module File | Routes File |
|---|---|---|
| Students | `students_module.dart` | `students_routes.dart` |
| Staff | `staff_module.dart` | `staff_routes.dart` |
| Finance | `finance_module.dart` | `finance_routes.dart` |
| Academics | `academics_module.dart` | `academics_routes.dart` |
| Exams | `exams_module.dart` | `exams_routes.dart` |
| Attendance | `attendance_module.dart` | `attendance_routes.dart` |
| Communication | `communication_module.dart` | `communication_routes.dart` |
| Settings | `settings_module.dart` | `settings_routes.dart` |
| Reports | `reports_module.dart` | `reports_routes.dart` |

