### Phase 3 — Core Layer Hardening

#### [MODIFY] [lib/core/theme/edu_colors.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/core/theme/edu_colors.dart)

No changes needed — already correct. ✅

#### [MODIFY] [lib/core/theme/design_tokens.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/core/theme/design_tokens.dart)

No changes needed — already correct. ✅

#### [NEW] `lib/core/widgets/edu_page_shell.dart`

Standard wrapper used by ALL pages. Prevents crashes from missing scaffold:

```dart
class EduPageShell extends StatelessWidget {
  final String title;
  final Widget body;
  final List<Widget>? actions;
  // ...
}
```

**Every screen uses `EduPageShell` instead of raw `Scaffold`.** This means if we change the app's page structure once, all pages update automatically.

#### [NEW] `lib/core/widgets/edu_error_boundary.dart`

Wraps each module shell so a crash in one feature doesn't crash the whole app:

```dart
class EduErrorBoundary extends StatefulWidget {
  // Catches errors in subtree, shows EduEmptyState fallback
}
```

