### Phase 6 — Data Layer Audit

#### [MODIFY] [lib/data/side_menu_data.dart](file:///c:/Users/ENG%20AHMAD/Documents/GitHub/edufusion/lib/data/side_menu_data.dart)

Shrink to ~50 lines — delegate to `ModuleRegistry`.

#### [MODIFY] `lib/data/repositories/`

Every repository must have:
1. **Abstract interface**: `student_repository.dart`
2. **Implementation**: `student_repository_impl.dart`  
3. **No raw Supabase calls in screens** — always through repository

#### [MODIFY] `lib/data/services/`

All services guarded:
- Never return `null` without explicit null type (`T?`)
- All Supabase calls use `school_id` in WHERE clause (RLS + defense-in-depth)

