### Phase 8 — Security Hardening

Per the **frontend-security-coder** skill:

| Area | Action |
|---|---|
| **Input validation** | All form fields use `InputValidator` (already exists in `lib/core/utils/`) |
| **Auth guard** | All protected routes check `AuthBloc` state before rendering |
| **Supabase RLS** | All queries must include `school_id` filter (defense-in-depth) |
| **Secure storage** | Tokens stored in `flutter_secure_storage`, NOT `shared_preferences` |
| **No `.env` in assets** | Already enforced in `pubspec.yaml` ✅ |
| **Error messages** | Never expose raw database errors to users |

---

## Design System Compliance (ALL Phases)

Per the **frontend-design** skill and GEMINI.md:

- ❌ No hardcoded `Color(0xFF...)` values — use `EduColors.*`
- ❌ No hardcoded `16.0` padding — use `DesignTokens.spacing16` or `ext.spacingM`
- ❌ No raw `Material` widgets in screens — use Edu* variants
- ✅ All pages use glassmorphism pattern via `GlassContainer` where appropriate
- ✅ Theme extension always accessed via `EduDesignExtension.mustOf(context)`

